WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.448
Today’s lesson goal: Today’s lesson goal: chain steps into a simple workflow. Keep humans in the loop where it matters. Log decisions so you can improve later.

2
00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:26.290
Workflow thinking: Workflow thinking: input, transform, check, output. Each step has a clear owner — model or human. Failures should stop or escalate, not silently invent.

3
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:36.380
Worked example: Worked example: draft a summary. Validate required fields. A human approves before send.

4
00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:48.990
Practice checkpoint: Practice checkpoint: draw a three-step workflow for a real task. Mark which steps need a human. Then continue in the written Module 6 lesson.
